			"styles": "\n\tdiv {\n\t\t/* U+00A0 glued to the property stays glued: one ident to css-syntax, a separator to parseCss */\n\t\tcolor : red;\n\n\t\t/* an ASCII space ahead of the run is a token separator and is kept, as one space */\n\t\ttop  : 0;\n\n\t\t/* in a comment-bearing gap, on either side of the comment */\n\t\tleft  /* comment */ : 0;\n\n\t\tright /* comment */  : 0;\n\t}\n",
